WEBVTT

00:30.060 --> 00:31.210
Hey!

00:34.210 --> 00:35.340
Bark bark!

00:37.680 --> 00:38.920
You dropped this!

00:42.310 --> 00:44.350
Thanks, Miss Fox!

00:44.350 --> 00:46.460
That's a very cute handkerchief.

00:46.460 --> 00:48.110
Thanks! Bye-bye!

00:54.990 --> 00:57.320
What's this? It looks delicious!

00:59.080 --> 01:02.740
I want to eat that! But 
it looks really expensive.

01:05.460 --> 01:07.880
Okay, I'll buy it! I'll splurge on it!

01:08.870 --> 01:09.960
Excuse me!

01:15.410 --> 01:17.640
W-What's going on?

01:18.880 --> 01:21.830
<i>Attention everyone, this is 
Yanagida, your captain, speaking.</i>

01:22.460 --> 01:26.940
<i>This airplane has taken damage 
and can no longer sustain flight.</i>

01:27.730 --> 01:30.720
<i>We will begin descent in preparation 
for an emergency landing.</i>

01:39.950 --> 01:41.700
We are descending at high speed.

01:41.700 --> 01:44.030
Everyone, please put on your emergency masks...

01:42.400 --> 01:45.410
<i>Pull hard on the mask above your 
heads, tighten your seat belt,</i>

01:45.410 --> 01:47.820
<i>and please position yourselves to brace for impact.</i>

01:57.250 --> 01:58.480
We're falling!

01:58.950 --> 02:00.100
I don't want to die!

02:00.100 --> 02:01.340
I'm scared!

02:01.340 --> 02:02.000
It's okay!

02:02.000 --> 02:03.010
Somebody help me!

02:03.010 --> 02:04.000
Hilfe!

02:05.520 --> 02:06.730
<i>Am I...</i>

02:07.500 --> 02:09.900
<i>going to die here, of all places?</i>

02:14.230 --> 02:19.660
<i>This time... I wanted to be sure 
I lived a life with no regrets...</i>

02:22.730 --> 02:24.970
<i>No... more than anything...</i>

02:25.950 --> 02:28.260
<i>I planned to save so many more...</i>

04:02.320 --> 04:03.760
It's a ruptured spleen.

04:03.760 --> 04:05.260
Blood pressure has fallen!

04:05.580 --> 04:06.460
What about a blood transfusion?

04:06.460 --> 04:07.770
We're already doing that.

04:07.770 --> 04:11.140
But the bleed is too heavy. 
Blood pressure isn't returning to normal!

04:19.320 --> 04:20.680
Doctor Takamoto!

04:21.740 --> 04:23.280
What's the patient's condition?

04:23.280 --> 04:25.240
Blood pressure has dropped below 60!

04:25.610 --> 04:28.240
D-Doctor Takamoto...

04:28.240 --> 04:32.000
Tanaka-san, what should we be doing here?

04:38.040 --> 04:39.550
Make an abdominal incision,

04:39.550 --> 04:43.390
find the blood vessel in the spleen 
that's bleeding, and stop it.

04:43.390 --> 04:46.060
Then, depending on the damage to the spleen,

04:46.060 --> 04:48.640
we'll decide whether it needs 
to be removed or not.

04:49.260 --> 04:50.420
Correct.

04:51.340 --> 04:54.750
We are going to save this patient's life.

04:56.600 --> 04:57.600
Yes, ma'am.

05:10.060 --> 05:11.290
Let's begin.

05:17.320 --> 05:18.630
Aoi!

05:19.140 --> 05:20.430
Hmm?

05:20.430 --> 05:23.120
Don't "hmm" me!

05:23.120 --> 05:25.970
I heard you completed another 
perfect surgery today.

05:25.970 --> 05:27.530
S-Stop it!

05:28.480 --> 05:30.110
That Tanaka...

05:30.110 --> 05:33.520
He said, "I have seen the work of a master 
surgeon!" He was so excited!

05:33.830 --> 05:35.520
Hey, great surgeon!

05:35.520 --> 05:37.500
Just stop it!

05:37.500 --> 05:38.910
The Surgeon Queen!

05:40.070 --> 05:42.960
What's "the Surgeon Queen" supposed to mean?

05:42.960 --> 05:44.530
That doesn't make any sense.

05:44.530 --> 05:47.780
And I see this is the same as ever, too.

05:49.830 --> 05:54.390
Your handwriting in the surgeon's log earlier
was so bad nobody could make that out either.

05:54.390 --> 05:56.080
I-I'm sorry...

05:56.080 --> 06:00.540
Don't worry. I'll decipher it and 
rewrite it, like I always do.

06:00.540 --> 06:02.270
Thanks, I appreciate it!

06:02.640 --> 06:04.100
But in exchange...

06:04.700 --> 06:06.550
Come have dinner with me tonight.

06:07.970 --> 06:09.050
Of course!

06:09.380 --> 06:11.250
Do you mind if one of the younger docs comes?

06:11.250 --> 06:16.180
This one seems to really look up to you,
and keeps begging for an introduction.

06:16.680 --> 06:18.440
You think I'd say no?

06:18.710 --> 06:20.150
I don't!

06:24.160 --> 06:26.320
You're really amazing, Aoi.

06:26.320 --> 06:29.040
You always know the latest trends 
in medical technology.

06:26.340 --> 06:34.820
Reception

06:29.040 --> 06:31.430
You've never had a single failed surgery!

06:31.430 --> 06:33.490
You're a true MonDoc!

06:33.490 --> 06:34.830
"MonDoc"?

06:35.180 --> 06:37.340
Short for "Monster Doctor."

06:37.340 --> 06:38.650
What?

06:38.650 --> 06:41.460
That's the nickname I came up with for you!

06:42.350 --> 06:44.840
You mean that "Surgeon Queen" earlier was also...

06:45.090 --> 06:48.590
You want to go to a place that has 
that thing you love, right?

06:50.350 --> 06:51.340
Yeah!

06:57.720 --> 07:00.100
It... It's...

07:01.060 --> 07:02.100
It's?

07:02.100 --> 07:05.110
The real Surgeon Queen!

07:05.470 --> 07:06.710
Surgeon Queen...

07:07.200 --> 07:09.990
How does it feel to see 
Takamoto Aoi up close?

07:10.490 --> 07:11.990
She's the coolest!

07:12.760 --> 07:14.320
These hands...

07:15.240 --> 07:17.750
They've completed so many miraculous surgeries!

07:18.480 --> 07:19.960
Why are you taking photos of them?

07:19.960 --> 07:21.480
To make them my phone wallpaper!

07:21.480 --> 07:23.170
Like a power spot thing?

07:23.170 --> 07:26.460
Like, just having the photos will 
improve all your doctorly skills?

07:26.460 --> 07:27.380
Yes!

07:29.770 --> 07:31.710
This could be a business, don't you think?

07:31.710 --> 07:32.420
Stop it.

07:33.160 --> 07:37.260
I wish I could get a punch from
Doctor Takamoto's godly hands, too!

07:38.280 --> 07:40.520
I think it's time to calm down...

07:40.520 --> 07:42.460
I can't calm down!

07:42.460 --> 07:48.280
Doctor Takamoto, you're Toutei University 
Hospital's genius surgeon! Our greatest pride!

07:48.580 --> 07:52.490
You're the person every surgeon at Toutei 
should aim to become!

07:52.490 --> 07:54.640
I don't know about that...

07:54.640 --> 07:57.270
I can't say I don't understand how you feel.

08:00.330 --> 08:02.270
I admire her, too.

08:04.410 --> 08:05.640
Shouko.

08:07.080 --> 08:09.550
Okay, what do we order next?

08:10.480 --> 08:12.050
This one looks so good.

08:12.430 --> 08:14.930
But the chocolate cake looks good, too.

08:16.570 --> 08:19.770
You really like sweets,
 don't you, Doctor Takamoto?

08:19.770 --> 08:23.980
She doesn't smoke or drink, so it's the 
one thing Aoi looks forward to.

08:23.980 --> 08:27.060
Does your body not break 
down alcohol or something?

08:27.790 --> 08:29.830
No, it's not that.

08:29.830 --> 08:33.570
It's to retain my self-control, I guess.

08:33.570 --> 08:37.760
What, really? You only get one chance at life.

08:37.760 --> 08:40.900
It's a waste not to enjoy it to the fullest.

08:41.570 --> 08:43.660
Yeah, you're right.

08:44.320 --> 08:45.370
But...

08:45.370 --> 08:47.120
that's exactly why...

08:47.120 --> 08:49.180
It's because you only get one chance at life...

08:49.180 --> 08:54.480
This time, I want to live earnestly,
to face everything with sincerity.

08:55.800 --> 08:58.030
"This time"?

08:59.410 --> 09:02.030
Never mind! It's nothing.

09:09.320 --> 09:11.780
I got careless back there.

09:13.990 --> 09:15.480
Um...

09:15.820 --> 09:19.450
Are you Doctor Takamoto?

09:19.720 --> 09:21.620
Huh? Yes.

09:22.310 --> 09:23.860
I knew it!

09:23.860 --> 09:26.390
I can't believe I'm 
meeting you in a place like this!

09:27.410 --> 09:31.220
Um... Thank you for everything you 
did during my mother's surgery.

09:31.730 --> 09:33.150
Your mother's...?

09:33.820 --> 09:37.470
Yes, you performed surgery for 
her pancreatic cancer.

09:37.470 --> 09:40.720
All the hospitals said 
it was impossible.

09:41.780 --> 09:45.010
But you... Doctor Takamoto, 
you were the only one...

09:45.510 --> 09:47.450
I will save you.

09:48.270 --> 09:49.480
Whatever it takes!

09:54.110 --> 09:58.410
And just like you said, the 
surgery was a success!

10:08.600 --> 10:11.450
Thanks to you, my mom's so much better now.

10:11.450 --> 10:17.290
She's saying things every day that 
she never would've said before.

10:19.120 --> 10:23.270
She tells me and dad that she loves us.

10:25.320 --> 10:28.350
I'm sorry to spring this conversation on you!

10:28.350 --> 10:31.260
Truly, thank you so very much.

10:36.090 --> 10:38.220
"I love you," huh?

10:38.680 --> 10:42.690
I've never said those words 
or had anyone say them to me.

10:44.060 --> 10:46.500
<i>Because in my last life...</i>

10:48.010 --> 10:50.260
<i>the one I loved didn't love me back.</i>

10:55.600 --> 10:57.030
<i>Even worse than that...</i>

10:57.630 --> 10:59.270
Kill her, now!

10:59.270 --> 11:00.970
You evil woman!

11:04.640 --> 11:06.510
Elise de Clorence!

11:07.840 --> 11:10.000
Any last words?

11:14.620 --> 11:18.740
The Marquis... Your father 
and older brother are dead!

11:20.880 --> 11:25.240
All of this is due to
 your mistakes and yours alone.

11:28.490 --> 11:35.500
We will now hold the execution of the 
former Empress of Britia, Elise de Clorence.

11:55.850 --> 11:57.020
<i>But...</i>

11:57.560 --> 12:02.530
<i>now I'm Takamoto Aoi, and 
I'm leading my second life.</i>

12:03.080 --> 12:04.330
<i>And that's why...</i>

12:04.330 --> 12:07.820
Aoi, your strawberry cake's here!

12:09.160 --> 12:11.640
Okay! I'm coming!

12:13.730 --> 12:16.240
Sorry, we ended up staying out pretty late.

12:16.240 --> 12:17.660
You have an early morning tomorrow, right?

12:17.660 --> 12:18.960
No, it's fine.

12:19.480 --> 12:22.840
D'you have something you're 
doing t'morrow, Doctor Takamoto?

12:22.840 --> 12:25.540
We told you already. 
She's going to Germany.

12:25.540 --> 12:28.970
They called her in as the surgeon 
for a heart bypass surgery.

12:28.970 --> 12:30.460
Oh, right!

12:30.460 --> 12:31.980
Do your best out there!

12:32.520 --> 12:35.620
Knowing Aoi, everything
 will be a complete success.

12:35.620 --> 12:36.230
Right?

12:36.750 --> 12:38.250
Yeah. I'll do my best.

12:48.850 --> 12:51.680
This book and I go way back.

12:55.150 --> 12:56.790
Hey, wait up!

12:57.870 --> 12:59.250
Ugh. It's Takamoto.

12:59.680 --> 13:00.910
Hey, did you know?

13:00.910 --> 13:03.210
They say Takamoto doesn't have
a mom and dad.

13:03.210 --> 13:04.420
I did know!

13:04.420 --> 13:07.260
That's why mama said not to play with her!

13:08.560 --> 13:09.790
Let's go!

13:08.960 --> 13:10.260
See? That girl...

13:10.930 --> 13:12.720
Poor thing.

13:15.110 --> 13:19.480
<i>I was orphaned as soon as I was born, 
and was always an object of curiosity.</i>

13:19.480 --> 13:23.060
<i>I lived my life without all the things that 
other kids my age took for granted.</i>

13:23.060 --> 13:25.730
<i>Not even the love of a parent.</i>

13:27.680 --> 13:28.680
<i>But...</i>

13:30.070 --> 13:32.250
<i>I didn't want to let the loneliness win.</i>

13:33.560 --> 13:35.780
<b>Children's Home</b>

13:38.520 --> 13:43.050
<i>I brought misery to everyone 
around me in my first life.</i>

13:43.990 --> 13:47.560
<i>To make up for the mistakes 
that Elise de Clorence made...</i>

13:48.490 --> 13:50.930
<i>To atone for all the wrongdoings I'd committed...</i>

13:55.490 --> 13:57.230
<i>I became a doctor.</i>

13:59.550 --> 14:02.000
<i>To save as many lives as I could,</i>

14:02.570 --> 14:05.640
<i>and to bring happiness to as 
many people as I could...</i>

14:08.510 --> 14:09.660
<i>Yes.</i>

14:09.660 --> 14:12.580
<i>I believe that this is what I must do with my life.</i>

14:16.770 --> 14:18.660
All right. Goodbye.

14:18.660 --> 14:19.820
Thank you.

14:20.310 --> 14:24.370
<i>Take care on your way here, Doctor Takamoto.</i>

14:24.370 --> 14:27.870
<i>This patient is relying on you. You are their hope.</i>

14:31.300 --> 14:32.910
<i>I'm their hope.</i>

14:35.150 --> 14:36.770
<i>That makes me happy.</i>

14:38.400 --> 14:41.990
<i>I wanted to be a doctor 
to atone for my crimes,</i>

14:43.280 --> 14:46.580
<i>but I'm proud I chose this path.</i>

14:51.080 --> 14:52.890
<i>If everyone was here...</i>

14:53.320 --> 14:56.410
<i>would they be happy to see me like this?</i>

15:02.970 --> 15:06.880
<i>Despite the kind of person I was, 
my family was always kind...</i>

15:07.900 --> 15:10.450
<i>Father, Mother...</i>

15:11.250 --> 15:12.560
<i>my older brother Ren...</i>

15:13.100 --> 15:14.510
<i>and my older brother Chris...</i>

15:17.360 --> 15:18.860
<i>I miss you all so much.</i>

15:21.700 --> 15:25.150
<i>No, no! This isn't the right mindset!</i>

15:31.320 --> 15:32.640
<i>Just wait for me.</i>

15:33.300 --> 15:36.070
<i>I'll make sure your surgery is a success!</i>

15:55.250 --> 15:56.410
I don't want to die!

15:56.410 --> 15:57.350
I'm scared!

15:57.350 --> 15:58.200
Somebody help me!

15:58.200 --> 15:59.230
Hilfe!

15:59.230 --> 16:02.480
<i>Am I going to die here of all places?</i>

16:06.630 --> 16:11.520
<i>This time... I wanted to be sure 
I lived a life with no regrets...</i>

16:15.110 --> 16:17.880
<i>No... more than anything...</i>

16:17.880 --> 16:20.330
<i>I planned to save so many more...</i>

16:24.530 --> 16:27.290
<i>I wanted to save people's lives!</i>

16:45.970 --> 16:47.340
I'm alive...

17:20.640 --> 17:23.230
<i>I don't want to have any more regrets...</i>

17:23.690 --> 17:27.270
<i>I won't have any more regrets!</i>

17:28.360 --> 17:29.370
Found it!

17:31.390 --> 17:33.900
Mommy! Mommy!

17:34.940 --> 17:35.860
What's wrong?

17:36.250 --> 17:37.760
My mom...

17:39.740 --> 17:41.540
I'll save her.

17:42.180 --> 17:43.160
Okay!

17:53.330 --> 17:54.590
That should do it...

18:07.930 --> 18:09.210
That's...

18:12.390 --> 18:16.660
I need to look at his abdominal organs 
and make sure they're not damaged...

18:23.440 --> 18:25.360
I will save you...

18:29.320 --> 18:32.200
I promise I'll save you!

18:42.380 --> 18:43.820
It's okay.

18:44.490 --> 18:45.700
It won't be long now.

18:54.890 --> 18:56.420
Everyone will survive.

18:57.970 --> 18:59.530
I'm so glad.

19:19.660 --> 19:24.130
It's no good. I can't...

19:43.160 --> 19:45.250
<i>I wish I could have seen them once more.</i>

19:50.350 --> 19:51.800
<i>If I could...</i>

19:55.530 --> 19:57.570
<i>I'm sure I would...</i>

20:11.140 --> 20:16.070
Oh, Pallas! You escaped from 
your cage again, didn't you?

20:22.320 --> 20:25.070
Pallas? But how...?

20:31.740 --> 20:33.160
This place...

20:41.170 --> 20:44.720
Mistress, are you awake?

20:45.000 --> 20:48.680
Um, as of today, you're no 
longer confined to your room...

20:49.900 --> 20:51.600
Mistress Elise?

20:52.260 --> 20:53.550
<i>Elise...?</i>

20:56.880 --> 21:00.850
<i>I'm back inside Elise's body?</i>

21:02.640 --> 21:08.460
Also, there's a banquet later.
If you don't begin your preparations soon...

21:08.460 --> 21:09.170
Mary!

21:09.170 --> 21:09.990
Y-Yes, Mistress?!

21:09.990 --> 21:11.900
If there's a banquet, will everyone be there?

21:11.900 --> 21:14.750
Father? And Mother? And my brothers?

21:15.050 --> 21:17.420
Y-Yes, of course.

21:20.300 --> 21:23.510
<i>I don't know why this has happened.</i>

21:26.100 --> 21:27.010
<i>But...</i>

21:38.570 --> 21:41.530
Father... Mother...

21:42.250 --> 21:45.530
My older brothers, Chris and Ren...

21:54.210 --> 21:55.770
I've missed you!

21:58.190 --> 22:01.050
I love all of you so much!

22:02.590 --> 22:04.110
I love you!

22:06.820 --> 22:10.040
Atonement
